msgid "Controller features"
msgstr "控制器功能"

msgid ""
"Godot supports controller-specific features that can further enhance the "
"gameplay experience. This page describes these features, how existing games "
"have used them, and how you can get started with them in Godot."
msgstr ""
"Godot 支援一些控制器專屬功能，可以進一步提升遊戲體驗。本頁面將介紹這些功能，"
"現有遊戲如何使用它們，以及如何在 Godot 中開始使用這些功能。"

msgid ""
"These controller features are currently only supported on Windows, macOS, "
"iOS, and Linux."
msgstr "目前，這些控制器功能僅在 Windows、macOS、iOS 和 Linux 平台上受支援。"

msgid ""
"Unless you specifically advertise your game as requiring specific "
"controllers, remember that there is no guarantee that players will have a "
"controller with any given features."
msgstr ""
"除非你明確宣傳了你的遊戲需要特定的控制器，否則請記住，不能保證玩家會擁有具有"
"任何特定功能的控制器。"

msgid ""
"As a result, we suggest using these features to enhance the gameplay "
"experience for players whose controllers support them, without detracting "
"from those who don't have controllers."
msgstr ""
"因此，我們建議使用這些功能來增強支援這些功能的控制器玩家的遊戲體驗，同時又不"
"影響沒有控制器的玩家的遊戲體驗。"

msgid "LED color"
msgstr "LED 顏色"

msgid ""
"Games can use the LED lights on certain controllers to subtly complement the "
"on-screen gameplay by providing some matching visuals in the player's hands. "
"Here are some notable examples:"
msgstr ""
"遊戲可以利用某些控制器上的 LED 燈光，通過在玩家手中提供相應的視覺效果，巧妙地"
"補充螢幕上的遊戲畫面。以下是一些值得注意的範例："

msgid ""
"In *Hades*, the color of the light matches the god you're receiving a boon "
"from."
msgstr "在 *Hades* （《哈迪斯》）中，燈光的顏色與你獲得恩惠的神祇相對應。"

msgid ""
"In *Resident Evil 2*, the color of the light indicates your health (green "
"for full, yellow for medium, red for low)."
msgstr ""
"在 *生化危機2* 中，燈光的顏色表示了你的生命值（綠色表示滿，黃色表示中等，紅色"
"表示低）。"

msgid ""
"In *Star Wars Jedi: Fallen Order*, the color of the light matches your "
"lightsaber's color."
msgstr "在 *星球大戰絕地：隕落的武士團* 中，燈光的顏色與你的光劍顏色相匹配。"

msgid ""
"Use the "
"method :ref:`Input.set_joy_light()<class_Input_method_set_joy_light>` to set "
"the color of a given controller's LEDs."
msgstr ""
"使用方法 :ref:`Input.set_joy_light()<class_Input_method_set_joy_light>` 可設"
"定給定控制器的 LED 的顏色。"

msgid ""
"To determine if a given controller supports setting LED lights, use "
"the :ref:`Input.has_joy_light()<class_Input_method_has_joy_light>` method. "
"The PlayStation DualShock and DualSense controllers are known to support LED "
"lights."
msgstr ""
"要確定某個控制器是否支援設定 LED 燈光，請使"
"用 :ref:`Input.has_joy_light()<class_Input_method_has_joy_light>` 方法。已知 "
"PlayStation DualShock 和 DualSense 控制器支援設定 LED 燈光。"

msgid ""
"The following ``_process()`` method sets the LED color according to the "
"currently pressed button, and turns it off if no button is being pressed:"
msgstr ""
"以下 ``_process()`` 方法會根據目前按下的按鈕設定 LED 顏色，如果沒有按下按鈕，"
"則將其關閉："

msgid "The following example smoothly fades the LED through hues in a loop:"
msgstr "以下範例以循環方式平滑地淡入淡出 LED 燈的顏色："

msgid ""
"The following example makes the LED blink red three times when the south "
"button (Cross/X on PlayStation controllers) is pressed:"
msgstr ""
"以下範例演示了當按下南側按鈕（PlayStation 控制器上的十字/X 鍵）時，LED 指示燈"
"將閃爍紅色三次："

msgid "Motion sensors (gyroscope and accelerometer)"
msgstr "運動傳感器（陀螺儀和加速度計）"

msgid ""
"With motion controls, games can track the controller's physical rotation and "
"movement. This can be used to let the player turn the in-game camera by "
"moving their controller, or shaking their controller to perform a special "
"action."
msgstr ""
"借助運動控制，遊戲可以追蹤控制器的物理旋轉和移動。這可用於讓玩家通過移動控制"
"器來轉動遊戲內的相機視角，或通過搖晃控制器來執行特殊動作。"

msgid ""
"There are several controller brands that have implemented gyroscope and "
"accelerometer sensors into their modern controllers, the biggest two being "
"PlayStation and Nintendo. Note that the Xbox controllers don't have motion "
"sensors inside of them."
msgstr ""
"目前，已有多個控制器品牌在其現代控制器中集成了陀螺儀和加速度計傳感器，其中最"
"具代表性的兩大品牌是 PlayStation 和 Nintendo。請注意，Xbox 控制器內部並未配備"
"運動傳感器。"

msgid ""
"To check if a connected controller has motion sensors, "
"use :ref:`Input.has_joy_motion_sensors()<class_Input_method_has_joy_motion_sensors>`."
msgstr ""
"要檢查連接的控制器是否具備運動傳感器，請使"
"用 :ref:`Input.has_joy_motion_sensors()<class_Input_method_has_joy_motion_sensors>`。"

msgid ""
"Motion sensors are disabled by default to avoid draining the controller "
"battery when games don't use those features. To enable them, "
"call :ref:`Input.set_joy_motion_sensors_enabled()<class_Input_method_set_joy_motion_sensors_enabled>`."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，運動傳感器是停用的，以避免在遊戲不使用這些功能時消耗控制器的電池"
"電量。要啟用它們，請呼"
"叫 :ref:`Input.set_joy_motion_sensors_enabled()<class_Input_method_set_joy_motion_sensors_enabled>`。"

msgid ""
"Note that the axes of the values that controller's motion sensors report are "
"always relative to the controller's natural orientation. Here's an image of "
"the axes mapping for more clarity:"
msgstr ""
"運動傳感器報告的數值座標軸始終相對於控制器的自然朝向。為了更清晰地說明，以下"
"是座標軸映射的示意圖："

msgid ""
"The controller's gyroscope values show rotation around their respective axes:"
msgstr "控制器的陀螺儀數值顯示了其各自座標軸上的旋轉情況："

msgid ""
"the X value of the gyroscope data shows the rotation around the X axis "
"(pitch)."
msgstr "陀螺儀資料中的 X 值表示繞 X 軸的旋轉（俯仰角）。"

msgid ""
"the Y value of the gyroscope data shows the rotation around the Y axis (yaw)."
msgstr "陀螺儀資料的 Y 值表示繞 Y 軸的旋轉（偏航）。"

msgid ""
"the Z value of the gyroscope data shows the rotation around the Z axis "
"(roll)."
msgstr "陀螺儀資料的 Z 值表示繞 Z 軸的旋轉（滾轉）。"

msgid ""
"The controller's accelerometer will provide values in the following ways, "
"respectively:"
msgstr "控制器的加速度計將以各自對應的方式提供以下數值："

msgid "Movement left and right are reported as **+X** and **-X**."
msgstr "左右移動分別報告為 **+X** 和 **-X**。"

msgid "Movement down and up are reported as **+Y** and **-Y**."
msgstr "上下移動分別報告為 **+Y** 和 **-Y**。"

msgid ""
"Movement away from and towards the user are reported as **+Z** and **-Z**."
msgstr "遠離和靠近使用者移動分別報告為 **+Z** 和 **-Z**。"

msgid "Gyroscope"
msgstr "陀螺儀"

msgid ""
"A **gyroscope** is a type of sensor that detects the controller's rotation. "
"Here are some notable examples of gyroscope use in games:"
msgstr ""
"**陀螺儀** 是一種用於檢測控制器旋轉的傳感器。以下是陀螺儀在遊戲中的幾個典型應"
"用範例："

msgid ""
"In *Helldivers 2*, *Horizon Forbidden West*, *Star Wars: Dark Forces "
"Remaster*, and *Fortnite*, tilting the controller causes the camera to "
"rotate accordingly (\"gyro aiming\"). `This video by *Daven On The Moon* "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vlfg9yku2hY>`_ demonstrates and discusses "
"gyro aiming in more detail."
msgstr ""
"在 *Helldivers 2* 、 *Horizon Forbidden West* 、 *Star Wars: Dark Forces "
"Remaster* 以及 *Fortnite* 中，傾斜控制器會讓遊戲視角隨之轉動（也就是所謂的 "
"\"體感瞄准\" ）。`This video by *Daven On The Moon* <https://www.youtube.com/"
"watch?v=Vlfg9yku2hY>`_ 更詳細地演示並探討了體感瞄准的相關細節。"

msgid ""
"In *Death Stranding*, BB can be soothed by rotating the controller softly."
msgstr "在 *《死亡擱淺》* 中，輕輕轉動控制器就能安撫 BB（小寶寶）。"

msgid ""
"The following example rotates an object using a controller's gyroscope "
"sensor. You can also access this example by taking a look at "
"the :ref:`Input.start_joy_motion_sensors_calibration()<class_Input_method_start_joy_motion_sensors_calibration>` "
"documentation."
msgstr ""
"下面的範例展示了如何使用控制器的陀螺儀傳感器來旋轉一個物體。你也可以通過查"
"閱 :ref:`Input.start_joy_motion_sensors_calibration()<class_Input_method_start_joy_motion_sensors_calibration>` "
"的文件來查看這個範例。"

msgid ""
"Note that before using the gyroscope's data, we must first calibrate it by "
"calling :ref:`Input.start_joy_motion_sensors_calibration()<class_Input_method_start_joy_motion_sensors_calibration>` "
"and :ref:`Input.stop_joy_motion_sensors_calibration()<class_Input_method_stop_joy_motion_sensors_calibration>`. "
"That's because modern gyroscopes often need calibration. This is like how a "
"weighing scale can need calibration to tell it what \"zero\" is. Like a "
"weighing scale, only a correctly calibrated gyroscope will give an accurate "
"reading. During calibration, the user sets the controller down on a flat "
"surface. The controller then determines what values its gyroscope reports "
"when it is actually not moving at all (its \"bias\"), and uses this "
"information to make its rotation data more accurate."
msgstr ""
"需要注意的是，在使用陀螺儀的資料之前，我們必須先通過呼"
"叫 :ref:`Input.start_joy_motion_sensors_calibration()<class_Input_method_start_joy_motion_sensors_calibration>` "
"和 :ref:`Input.stop_joy_motion_sensors_calibration()<class_Input_method_stop_joy_motion_sensors_calibration>` "
"來對它進行校准。這是因為現代的陀螺儀通常都需要校准。這就好比電子秤需要校准來"
"告訴它甚麼是 \"零\" 一樣。就像電子秤一樣，只有經過正確校准的陀螺儀才能給出準"
"確的讀數。在校准過程中，使用者需要把控制器平放在一個平坦的表面上。控制器隨後"
"會測定它在實際完全靜止不動時，陀螺儀所報告的數值（也就是它的 \"偏差\"），並利"
"用這些資訊來讓它的旋轉資料變得更加精准。"

msgid ""
"See `the article on GyroWiki <http://gyrowiki.jibbsmart.com/blog:good-gyro-"
"controls-part-1:the-gyro-is-a-mouse>`__ for information on how to use "
"gyroscope input as a mouse."
msgstr ""
"請參考 `the article on GyroWiki <http://gyrowiki.jibbsmart.com/blog:good-"
"gyro-controls-part-1:the-gyro-is-a-mouse>`__ 上的文章，瞭解如何將陀螺儀輸入模"
"擬為滑鼠操作。"

msgid ""
"After the controller's gyroscope has been enabled and correctly calibrated, "
"you can read its reported values by "
"using :ref:`Input.get_joy_gyroscope()<class_Input_method_get_joy_gyroscope>`."
msgstr ""
"在啟用控制器的陀螺儀並完成正確校准之後，你就可以通過呼"
"叫 :ref:`Input.get_joy_gyroscope()<class_Input_method_get_joy_gyroscope>` 來"
"讀取它上報的數值了。"

msgid "Accelerometer"
msgstr "加速度計"

msgid ""
"Do not use accelerometer data to find the controller's position in 3D space; "
"the accelerometers in general are not precise enough for this."
msgstr ""
"不要試圖用加速度計的資料來推算控制器在 3D 空間中的具體位置，因為一般的加速度"
"計根本不夠精准，做不到這一點。"

msgid ""
"An **accelerometer** is a type of sensor that detects a controller's "
"acceleration in m/s². For example, it can detect if the player quickly "
"raises their controller, moves it to the side, or shakes it."
msgstr ""
"**加速度計** 是一種能夠檢測控制器加速度（單位是 m/s²）的傳感器。比如，當玩家"
"快速舉起控制器、向旁邊揮動或者搖晃控制器時，它都能感應得到。"

msgid ""
"The acceleration that an accelerometer detects includes gravity by default. "
"To get *only* the acceleration imparted by the user, subtract gravity from "
"the detected acceleration:"
msgstr ""
"加速度計檢測到的加速度預設是包含重力的。如果想 *僅僅* 取得由玩家施加（也就是"
"你手部動作產生）的加速度，就需要從檢測到的總加速度中減去重力的影響。"

msgid ""
"Due to how accelerometers work physically, after movement in one direction "
"stops they almost immediately report movement in the opposite direction. "
"After detecting movement in one direction, you may want to ignore further "
"readings for a small period of time to avoid detecting this opposite "
"movement."
msgstr ""
"由於加速度計的物理工作原理，當朝某個方向的運動剛一停止，它幾乎會立刻報告一個"
"反方向的運動。因此，在檢測到某個方向的運動後，你可能需要在短時間內忽略後續的"
"讀數，以避免誤判這個反向運動。"

msgid ""
"The following example prints the controller movement when it's being quickly "
"moved by using its accelerometer. If the sensitivity doesn't feel right for "
"you, you can tweak the ``THRESHOLD`` constant or you can replace it by using "
"a different value in the code below."
msgstr ""
"下面的範例會在控制器被快速移動時，通過它的加速度計來輸出出移動資料。如果你覺"
"得（檢測的）靈敏度不太合適，可以調整 ``THRESHOLD`` 這個常數，或者在下面的程式"
"碼里直接換成別的數值。"
